    <string name="settings_online">Artwork and info from the internet</string>
    <string name="settings_online_note">Posters, backgrounds, IMDb ratings, cast and the popular rows come from Cinemeta, Stremio’s public movie database. Only movie IDs are sent, never personal details. Like any website, the server sees the TV’s IP address. Turn this off to stay fully offline.</string>
